{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"The Game Begins","artist":"뮤지컬 데스노트","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:055","sourceHash":"b23ddd9d904ce7c18eff1e37f12e1587e420687e1434d9b58c50571c3d267f40","duration":176.34,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":22.360816,"end":27.935,"text":"분노는 마음을 비추는 투명한 유리창","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":28.014875,"end":34.0,"text":"정의를 외치는 목소린 공허한 말장난","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":34.969252,"end":41.0,"text":"순교자 행세를 해봤자 너는 위선자야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":41.703039,"end":47.8,"text":"품속엔 거짓된 십자가뿐","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":48.669025,"end":54.6,"text":"어둠에 가려진 두 눈은 볼 수가 없는데","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":56.07619,"end":62.0,"text":"알지도 못하는 세상을 멋대로 색칠해","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":63.030567,"end":68.152,"text":"모든 걸 다 아는 것처럼 잘난 척을 하면서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":68.231837,"end":74.28,"text":"구세주 행세를 하고 있어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":77.392109,"end":80.191,"text":"내가 상대해주지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":80.271383,"end":83.825,"text":"게임 한판 즐겨볼까","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":83.905306,"end":87.94,"text":"그림자를 조심해","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":88.026848,"end":94.0,"text":"밟힌 순간 죽게 되는 게임이야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":97.999819,"end":103.92,"text":"거창한 이상을 내세운 건방진 멍청이","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":107.787029,"end":113.84,"text":"생명을 가지고 놀면서 착각에 빠졌어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":115.414785,"end":117.924,"text":"세상에 겁날 게 없겠지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":118.00381,"end":121.96,"text":"신이 된 것처럼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":122.044082,"end":128.02,"text":"너에게 지옥을 보여줄게","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":129.079728,"end":132.55,"text":"숫자들과 데이터","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":132.783311,"end":136.001,"text":"그래프를 분석해서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":136.080544,"end":140.087,"text":"이 세상의 규칙을","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":140.167256,"end":143.582,"text":"뼈저리게 알려주지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":143.661859,"end":146.182,"text":"끝을 알 수 없는 게임","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":146.262494,"end":149.674,"text":"이제 시작하는 거야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":149.733878,"end":153.389,"text":"인정사정없는 게임","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":153.44907,"end":156.605,"text":"주사윈 던져진 거야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":156.665034,"end":164.32,"text":"시작할까","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}